# What the Worker publishes as chrisdemetriou.com. The whole repo is the assets folder,
# so this is an allowlist: ignore everything, then let back in only the website.
# A new public folder must be added here, or it won't go live. Same rules as .gitignore.
# The bare names at the end are never published, even inside a public folder.
# The showreel (video/) is served from R2 by worker/index.js, not from here.
/*
!/index.html
!/404.html
!/creative/
!/privacy/
!/cookies/
!/work/
!/resources/
!/styles/
!/scripts/
!/fonts/
!/images/
!/robots.txt
!/sitemap.xml
!/llms.txt
!/favicon.ico
!/favicon-32.png
!/apple-touch-icon.png
!/icon-192.png
!/icon-512.png
!/og-image.jpg
.DS_Store
._*
